{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"function decide<TAdapter, TQuestions>(options): Promise<{ [K in string | number | symbol]: InferEvaluateAnswer<TQuestions[K]> } & object>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/evaluate/index.ts#L497","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/activities/evaluate/index.ts:497"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Ask typed questions about "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"state"},{"type":"text","value":" and get answers your code can branch on."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"You have state (a ticket, a record, a log) and you need typed answers, not\nprose. Pass questions built with "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"choice"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"score"},{"type":"text","value":", and "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"boolean"},{"type":"text","value":". Then\nbranch on "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"result.queue.value"},{"type":"text","value":" in ordinary TypeScript."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The question key "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"meta"},{"type":"text","value":" is reserved. Throws if "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"questions"},{"type":"text","value":" is empty or uses\nthat key."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"type-parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tadapter","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TAdapter"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TAdapter"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"extends"}]},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"link","href":"../interfaces/EvaluateAdapter.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"EvaluateAdapter"}]},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"string"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"EvaluateProviderOptions"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TAdapter"},{"type":"text","value":">>"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tquestions","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TQuestions"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TQuestions"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"extends"}]},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Record"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"string"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"link","href":"../type-aliases/WireQuestion.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"WireQuestion"}]},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"options","children":[{"type":"text","value":"options"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"EvaluateActivityOptions"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TAdapter"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TQuestions"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Promise"},{"type":"text","value":"<{ [K in string | number | symbol]: InferEvaluateAnswer<TQuestions[K]> } & "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"object"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Route a support ticket"}]}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { decide, choice, score, boolean } from '@tanstack/ai'\nimport { typesafeDecider } from '@tanstack/ai-typesafe'\n\nconst result = await decide({\n  adapter: typesafeDecider('jev-latest'),\n  state: ticket,\n  questions: {\n    queue: choice({\n      instructions: 'Which team should handle this ticket?',\n      options: {\n        billing: 'Payments, invoices, refunds',\n        tech: 'Bugs, outages, integrations',\n        sales: 'Pricing, upgrades, new accounts',\n      },\n    }),\n    urgency: score({\n      instructions: 'How urgent is this ticket?',\n      levels: ['low', 'medium', 'high'],\n    }),\n    refund: boolean({\n      instructions: 'Is the customer asking for a refund?',\n    }),\n  },\n})\n\nresult.queue.value\nresult.meta.model\nresult.meta.usage","lang":"ts"}],"headings":[{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tadapter","text":"TAdapter","level":3},{"id":"tquestions","text":"TQuestions","level":3},{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":2},{"id":"options","text":"options","level":3},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2},{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\nfunction decide<TAdapter, TQuestions>(options): Promise<{ [K in string | number | symbol]: InferEvaluateAnswer<TQuestions[K]> } & object>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/evaluate/index.ts:497](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/evaluate/index.ts#L497)\n\nAsk typed questions about `state` and get answers your code can branch on.\n\nYou have state (a ticket, a record, a log) and you need typed answers, not\nprose. Pass questions built with `choice`, `score`, and `boolean`. Then\nbranch on `result.queue.value` in ordinary TypeScript.\n\nThe question key `meta` is reserved. Throws if `questions` is empty or uses\nthat key.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TAdapter\n\n`TAdapter` *extends* [`EvaluateAdapter`](../interfaces/EvaluateAdapter.md)\\<`string`, `EvaluateProviderOptions`\\<`TAdapter`\\>\\>\n\n### TQuestions\n\n`TQuestions` *extends* `Record`\\<`string`, [`WireQuestion`](../type-aliases/WireQuestion.md)\\>\n\n## Parameters\n\n### options\n\n`EvaluateActivityOptions`\\<`TAdapter`, `TQuestions`\\>\n\n## Returns\n\n`Promise`\\<\\{ \\[K in string \\| number \\| symbol\\]: InferEvaluateAnswer\\<TQuestions\\[K\\]\\> \\} & `object`\\>\n\n## Example\n\n**Route a support ticket**\n\n```ts\nimport { decide, choice, score, boolean } from '@tanstack/ai'\nimport { typesafeDecider } from '@tanstack/ai-typesafe'\n\nconst result = await decide({\n  adapter: typesafeDecider('jev-latest'),\n  state: ticket,\n  questions: {\n    queue: choice({\n      instructions: 'Which team should handle this ticket?',\n      options: {\n        billing: 'Payments, invoices, refunds',\n        tech: 'Bugs, outages, integrations',\n        sales: 'Pricing, upgrades, new accounts',\n      },\n    }),\n    urgency: score({\n      instructions: 'How urgent is this ticket?',\n      levels: ['low', 'medium', 'high'],\n    }),\n    refund: boolean({\n      instructions: 'Is the customer asking for a refund?',\n    }),\n  },\n})\n\nresult.queue.value\nresult.meta.model\nresult.meta.usage\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: decide\ntitle: decide\n---\n\n```ts\nfunction decide<TAdapter, TQuestions>(options): Promise<{ [K in string | number | symbol]: InferEvaluateAnswer<TQuestions[K]> } & object>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/evaluate/index.ts:497](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/evaluate/index.ts#L497)\n\nAsk typed questions about `state` and get answers your code can branch on.\n\nYou have state (a ticket, a record, a log) and you need typed answers, not\nprose. Pass questions built with `choice`, `score`, and `boolean`. Then\nbranch on `result.queue.value` in ordinary TypeScript.\n\nThe question key `meta` is reserved. Throws if `questions` is empty or uses\nthat key.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TAdapter\n\n`TAdapter` *extends* [`EvaluateAdapter`](../interfaces/EvaluateAdapter.md)\\<`string`, `EvaluateProviderOptions`\\<`TAdapter`\\>\\>\n\n### TQuestions\n\n`TQuestions` *extends* `Record`\\<`string`, [`WireQuestion`](../type-aliases/WireQuestion.md)\\>\n\n## Parameters\n\n### options\n\n`EvaluateActivityOptions`\\<`TAdapter`, `TQuestions`\\>\n\n## Returns\n\n`Promise`\\<\\{ \\[K in string \\| number \\| symbol\\]: InferEvaluateAnswer\\<TQuestions\\[K\\]\\> \\} & `object`\\>\n\n## Example\n\n**Route a support ticket**\n\n```ts\nimport { decide, choice, score, boolean } from '@tanstack/ai'\nimport { typesafeDecider } from '@tanstack/ai-typesafe'\n\nconst result = await decide({\n  adapter: typesafeDecider('jev-latest'),\n  state: ticket,\n  questions: {\n    queue: choice({\n      instructions: 'Which team should handle this ticket?',\n      options: {\n        billing: 'Payments, invoices, refunds',\n        tech: 'Bugs, outages, integrations',\n        sales: 'Pricing, upgrades, new accounts',\n      },\n    }),\n    urgency: score({\n      instructions: 'How urgent is this ticket?',\n      levels: ['low', 'medium', 'high'],\n    }),\n    refund: boolean({\n      instructions: 'Is the customer asking for a refund?',\n    }),\n  },\n})\n\nresult.queue.value\nresult.meta.model\nresult.meta.usage\n```\n"}
